{
  "_note": [
    "HARD -- 'strong economy followed by continuous attacks', and 'attacks after eco has",
    "been established' (AI_Player_difficulty.md).",
    "",
    "THE ONE PLACE THE DIFFICULTY TABLE STOPS NAMING A CLOCK AND NAMES A STATE, which is",
    "the whole design in one line. Easy and Normal unlock aggression at 10 and 7 minutes",
    "because a handicap is honest about being a handicap. Hard has none, so its attack",
    "rule waits on the thing the sentence actually means:",
    "",
    "    12 villagers, a mill, a barracks and 8 swordsmen",
    "",
    "That is a definition of 'established', written down where it can be argued with,",
    "rather than a minute count somebody tuned once. It also makes Hard MAP-SENSITIVE in",
    "the right direction: on a poor map it attacks later, because it genuinely is not",
    "ready -- which is what the owner was asking for when they ruled out ticks.",
    "",
    "THE ECONOMY IS THE DIFFICULTY. Hard trains to 16 villagers before it thinks about",
    "an army at all, where Easy stops at 7. That single number is worth more than any",
    "amount of extra military rules: a bot with twice the income can replace what it",
    "loses, and 'continuous attacks' is a consequence of being able to afford them",
    "rather than a separate behaviour. The standing orders already send every idle",
    "soldier back out, so continuity is free once production keeps up.",
    "",
    "CASTLES ARE AGE 4 AND EXPENSIVE, and the rule sits last on purpose: reservation",
    "means a goal higher in the list holds its cost back, so a castle can never starve",
    "the army that keeps the bot alive while it saves for one."
  ],

  "id": "hard",
  "lag_ticks": [0, 15],
  "max_age": 4,
  "attacks": true,
  "techs": true,

  "rules": [
    {"do": "gather", "kind": "food", "units": 2,
     "when": {"age_max": 1, "gathering_fewer_than": {"food": 2}}},
    {"do": "gather", "kind": "stone", "units": 1,
     "when": {"age_max": 1, "gathering_fewer_than": {"stone": 1}}},
    {"do": "gather", "kind": "wood", "units": 2,
     "when": {"age_max": 1, "gathering_fewer_than": {"wood": 2}}},

    {"do": "build", "def": "building.house", "near": "self", "units": 1,
     "when": {"fewer_than": {"building.house": 1}}},

    {"do": "build", "def": "building.mining_camp", "near": "res.stone", "units": 1,
     "when": {"fewer_than": {"building.mining_camp": 1}}},
    {"do": "build", "def": "building.lumber_camp", "near": "res.tree", "units": 1,
     "when": {"fewer_than": {"building.lumber_camp": 1}}},

    {"do": "gather", "kind": "gold", "units": 1,
     "when": {"gathering_fewer_than": {"gold": 1}}},

    {"do": "train", "at": "building.town_center", "unit": "unit.villager", "count": 4,
     "when": {"fewer_than": {"unit.villager": 10}}},

    {"do": "advance_age",
     "when": {"age": 1, "at_least": {"unit.villager": 8}}},

    {"do": "build", "def": "building.mill", "near": "self", "units": 1,
     "when": {"age_min": 2, "fewer_than": {"building.mill": 1}}},
    {"do": "build", "def": "building.field", "near": "building.mill", "units": 1,
     "when": {"at_least": {"building.mill": 1}, "fewer_than": {"building.field": 3}}},
    {"do": "build", "def": "building.house", "near": "self", "units": 1,
     "when": {"fewer_than": {"building.house": 3}}},

    {"do": "train", "at": "building.town_center", "unit": "unit.villager", "count": 4,
     "when": {"fewer_than": {"unit.villager": 16}}},

    {"do": "build", "def": "building.barracks", "near": "self", "units": 1,
     "when": {"fewer_than": {"building.barracks": 1}}},
    {"do": "build", "def": "building.watch_tower", "near": "self", "units": 1,
     "when": {"fewer_than": {"building.watch_tower": 2}}},

    {"do": "advance_age",
     "when": {"age": 2, "at_least": {"unit.villager": 12, "building.mill": 1}}},

    {"do": "build", "def": "building.archery_range", "near": "self", "units": 1,
     "when": {"age_min": 3, "fewer_than": {"building.archery_range": 1}}},
    {"do": "build", "def": "building.stable", "near": "self", "units": 1,
     "when": {"age_min": 3, "fewer_than": {"building.stable": 1}}},
    {"do": "build", "def": "building.house", "near": "self", "units": 1,
     "when": {"fewer_than": {"building.house": 6}}},

    {"do": "train", "at": "building.barracks", "unit": "unit.swordsman", "count": 4,
     "when": {"at_least": {"building.barracks": 1}, "fewer_than": {"unit.swordsman": 12}}},
    {"do": "train", "at": "building.archery_range", "unit": "unit.archer", "count": 4,
     "when": {"at_least": {"building.archery_range": 1}, "fewer_than": {"unit.archer": 8}}},
    {"do": "train", "at": "building.stable", "unit": "unit.knight", "count": 2,
     "when": {"at_least": {"building.stable": 1}, "fewer_than": {"unit.knight": 4}}},

    {"do": "advance_age",
     "when": {"age": 3, "at_least": {"unit.villager": 16, "building.barracks": 1}}},

    {"do": "build", "def": "building.watch_tower", "near": "self", "units": 1,
     "when": {"age_min": 4, "fewer_than": {"building.watch_tower": 5}}},
    {"do": "build", "def": "building.castle", "near": "self", "units": 2,
     "when": {"age_min": 4, "fewer_than": {"building.castle": 1}}},

    {"do": "attack", "units": "military",
     "when": {"at_least": {"unit.villager": 12, "building.mill": 1,
                           "building.barracks": 1, "unit.swordsman": 8}}}
  ]
}
